  "description": "A fully managed, cross-platform renderer that turns GNU Texinfo source files into HTML and CSS. It reads standard Texinfo (.texi) documents as well as the .tely Texinfo dialect produced by LilyPond and CodeBrix.LilyPort, and it emits markup written specifically for PDF generation - the output is intended to be handed directly to CodeBrix.PdfDocCreate.Html2Pdf to produce a nicely formatted PDF document.",
